{"title":"The Newbie Is Too Strong","synopsis":"JaeJu yang berarti keterampilan dalam bahasa Korea tumbuh tanpa orang tua di panti asuhan dengan terampil seperti namanya Suatu hari dia mendengar bahwa panti asuhan sedang mengalami masa sulit dan harus ditutup dalam 3 tahun Saat mencoba mengumpulkan uang untuk panti asuhan JaeJu mendapat peringatan di teleponnya Di atasnya dia melihat video dirinya memanjat menara sebagai BJ penyiar alias streamer Tujuh tahun yang lalu sebuah menara tibatiba muncul dan secara acak membawa orang ke dalamnya Jika Anda berhasil menyelesaikan menara dan menjadi Awakened hanya masalah waktu sebelum Anda menjadi kaya","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"First Prize Lottery","artist":"MidAs","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"7b73f870-8e3b-435c-bc3a-46d03338b1ce","number":"162","title":"Chapter 162","date":"2026-02-25","images":[]},{"id":"c5d60694-46cb-4ce0-84e8-b94f363c2a0d","number":"161","title":"Chapter 161","date":"2026-02-23","images":[]},{"id":"326014f3-c21b-4505-b330-a26a330810e1","number":"160","title":"Chapter 160","date":"2026-02-23","images":[]},{"id":"894a4b41-22ae-4d9e-b1d0-9868170e442c","number":"159","title":"Chapter 159","date":"2026-01-21","images":[]},{"id":"89194eff-6e9d-4957-953e-78f7459e7185","number":"158","title":"Chapter 158","date":"2026-01-21","images":[]},{"id":"cf038c8e-989f-4886-be3e-6acd317a6f07","number":"157","title":"Chapter 157","date":"2026-01-09","images":[]},{"id":"621c8e80-1a45-46f0-b45d-28b481b6ca28","number":"156","title":"Chapter 156","date":"2025-12-25","images":[]},{"id":"a9319bf1-0d57-4059-b681-31a05aeeebb4","number":"155","title":"Chapter 155","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"id":"d95bbe53-c0fc-43b2-bd6b-b1931b69e685","number":"154","title":"Chapter 154","date":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"id":"b0479e55-6e05-4fdf-ba41-ae8e1e9f22d7","number":"153","title":"Chapter 153","date":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"id":"eb5c8853-3e28-4dbf-8716-bf8e02a58f26","number":"152","tit